## API

The API shared with [MulleCMarkGFM](//github.com/MulleWeb/MulleCMarkGFM)
is:

``` objc
- (NSString *) markdownedString;
- (NSData *) markdownedData;
```

plus the flagged variants `markdownedStringWithHTMLFlags:extensions:tocIndent:`
and `markdownedDataWithHTMLFlags:extensions:tocIndent:`. The method names and
flags are shared with MulleCMarkGFM, so source can be moved between the two;
each backend renders with its own native rules, so the output is not meant to be
identical. The flags are the `MULLE_MARKDOWN_HTML_*` and `MULLE_MARKDOWN_EXT_*`
constants.

MulleHoedown also keeps its original methods:

``` objc
- (NSString *) hoedownedString;
- (NSData *) hoedownedData;
```
